---
/**
 * The holding page for cms.murikah.com, and the only route the CMS host serves
 * while the product is redesigned (Build Prompt 00, clean-slate teardown).
 *
 * It exists so the address keeps resolving. The custom domain, the worker, the
 * host branch in src/worker.ts and the Turso credentials all stay as they are,
 * so nothing on the Cloudflare side has to be reconfigured when the redesign
 * lands. Every other path on this host falls through to the worker's neutral
 * not-found response.
 *
 * Deliberately inert: no navigation into a dead app, no sign-in form, no
 * database call, no secret read, no client JavaScript. It cannot fail, because
 * there is nothing in it to fail.
 *
 * The shared design tokens are pulled in through @/styles/global.css, which
 * imports @/styles/tokens.css, so the navy, brass and ivory palette and the
 * type scale are the same ones the rest of the estate uses. BaseLayout is
 * deliberately not used: it renders the marketing header and footer, and no
 * corporate navigation belongs on this host.
 */
import '@/styles/global.css';

const title = 'Murikah CMS';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-KE">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  </head>
  <body class="cms-holding">
    <main class="cms-holding__pane">
      <p class="cms-holding__eyebrow">Murikah</p>
      <h1 class="cms-holding__title">This platform is being rebuilt.</h1>
      <p class="cms-holding__body">
        The address is reserved and working. There is nothing to sign in to yet.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  /* Scoped to this page. Colours and type come from the shared tokens in
     @/styles/tokens.css, so this page cannot drift from the design system. */
  .cms-holding {
    display: grid;
    min-height: 100vh;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-ivory);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .cms-holding__pane {
    max-width: 34rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cms-holding__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-brass);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .cms-holding__title {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.1rem + 1.6vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .cms-holding__body {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-slate);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
